        <p>This groundbreaking new tank gives as good as she gets—dropping enemies left and right with her massive powerfists. With stunning combos, powerful knock-backs, and the strength to go toe-to-toe with BAMs and bosses, the brawler is a relentless fighter who can take charge of any situation.</p>
